 235:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedQueueOverflowCallback  : ADC group injected context queue overflow callback
 236:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow2Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 2 callback
 237:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow3Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 3 callback
 238:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) EndOfSamplingCallback          : ADC end of sampling callback
