1720:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
1721:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Enable ADC, start conversion of regular group with interruption.
1722:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Interruptions enabled in this function according to initialization
